# Nothing in this repository ROOT is ever a Vercel deployment source. The two
# real projects are deployed from their own directories:
#
#   website/website/glow-plus-backend/glow-plus-backend  -> glow-plus-api
#   website/website/glow-plus-web                        -> glow-plus-web
#
# This file exists because running `vercel` from the root once uploaded 130MB
# and failed on the 100MB limit: Vercel uses .vercelignore, NOT .gitignore, so
# the 129MB `website.zip` was sent even though git ignores it. Deploying from
# the wrong directory is now cheap to notice instead of a two-minute upload.
*.zip
node_modules
dist
.env
.env.*
